{"title":"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What non-zero real value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/f/cbf28549b1745c6a5570b26d0b34b1b73c605449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7x)^{14}=(14x)^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"19\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6be70af157b5d4da12e16d7ede425f202400804.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\frac17\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\frac27\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 1\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 7\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"372\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the seventh root of both sides, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37fddf0c275f276cbfd61e6d46fedd2967fe094a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7x)^2=14x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Simplifying the LHS gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f11804f3c547f1159ed062c59935f9fc5ccef123.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49x^2=14x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/2/62206833b2c2adbd30526152e13df4dcba2156cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be a non-zero value.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/6/6964eace293ecc75959e7fa1ccc98c7059b8feba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{2}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"96\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A\">2006 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Proble